<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classUdpBundleSink" kindref="compound">UdpBundleSink</ref> class encapsulates the appropriate UDP functionality to receive bundles (or any other user defined data) over a UDP socket and calls the user defined function WholeBundleReadyCallback_t when a new bundle is received. This class assumes an entire bundle is small enough to fit entirely in one UDP datagram. </para>
</sect1>
